+(Introduction)
+
+    None
+
+Additions to Chapter 2 of the OpenGL Shading Language 1.10 Specification
+(Overview of OpenGL Shading)
+
+    None
+
+Additions to Chapter 3 of the OpenGL Shading Language 1.10 Specification
+(Basics)
