+Overview
+	
+    Provides a mechanism for DrawPixels and ReadPixels to efficiently
+    transfer depth and stencil image data.  Specifically, we defined new
+    packed pixel formats and types which pack both stencil and depth
+    into one value.
+
+Issues:
