+XMesa (Xlib)		implements OpenGL 1.4
+OSMesa (off-screen)	implements OpenGL 1.4
+FX (3dfx Voodoo1/2)	implements OpenGL 1.3
+SVGA			implements OpenGL 1.3
+Wind River UGL		implements OpenGL 1.3
