+
+<h1>Mesa 7.0.3 Release Notes / April 4, 2008</h1>
+
+<p>
+Mesa 7.0.3 is a stable release with bug fixes since version 7.0.2.
+</p>
+
+
+<h2>MD5 checksums</h2>
