+for DRI hardware acceleration.
+</p>
+
+
+<h2>MD5 checksums</h2>
+<pre>
+78422843ea875ad4eac35b9b8584032b  MesaLib-7.9.1.tar.gz
+07dc6cfb5928840b8b9df5bd1b3ae434  MesaLib-7.9.1.tar.bz2
